cellHarmony/webapp/jobs/
# scALABLE-discover's job folders: its compose file binds this directory as the job volume,
# so every upload and result would otherwise enter the next image build (5.1 GB locally).
cellHarmony/scalable_discover/jobs/
# Per-module Python environments. ".venv/" above matches only at the context root, so
# Daedalus/.venv (1.8 GB) and Proteus/.proteus_venv (1.4 GB) entered every image. The image
# installs its own packages from cellHarmony/webapp/requirements.docker.txt.
**/.venv/
**/.proteus_venv/
cellHarmony/webapp/__pycache__/
cellHarmony/flask/__pycache__/
visualization/__pycache__/
